    "innovation": "This paper introduces a diagnostic in-cloud aerosol scavenging scheme for the ECHAM5-HAM global climate model, which determines scavenging ratios from cloud particle numbers and is coupled with a size-dependent impaction scavenging parameterization to improve aerosol lifecycle representation.",
